node_modules
# dist* rather than dist. Any build output directory is a copy of publicDir, so
# an unignored variant carries public/_proof/ into the context even though the
# rule below excludes the original. qa/vite.config.negctl.mjs builds to
# dist-negctl and did exactly that on the exclusion check's first run: 19 entries
# in the context, from the scratch output rather than from public/ itself.
dist*
.env*
*.md
public/_proof/
